@startuml authentication-flow
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam participantBorderColor #2B579A

title 多模式身份认证时序图 (Multi-Mode Authentication Flows)

actor "客户端 (Client)" as Client
participant "Filter Chain" as Chain
participant "CustomLoginFilter / \nCustomTokenAuthFilter" as Filter
participant "ProviderManager\n(AuthenticationManager)" as AuthManager
participant "CustomAuth / \nDaoAuthProvider" as Provider
participant "CustomUserDetailsService" as UserDetailsSvc
participant "PasswordEncoder" as Encoder
participant "SecurityContextRepository\n(HttpSession)" as CtxRepo
participant "AuthenticationEventListener" as EventListener

== 场景 A：自定义 JSON 登录流程 (POST /your-custom-login-path) ==
Client -> Chain : POST /your-custom-login-path\n(JSON: {"username":"admin","password":"admin"}\nHeader: X-CSRF-TOKEN)
Chain -> Filter : 拦截并解析 JSON Body
Filter -> Filter : 封装 UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken(user, pass)
Filter -> AuthManager : authenticate(authentication)
AuthManager -> Provider : 路由至 DaoAuthenticationProvider
Provider -> UserDetailsSvc : loadUserByUsername("admin")
UserDetailsSvc --> Provider : 返回 UserDetails(密文密码, 权限集合[admin])
Provider -> Encoder : matches(rawPassword, encodedPassword)
Encoder --> Provider : 密码比对成功
Provider --> AuthManager : 返回已认证 Authentication(主体, 凭据, 权限集合)
AuthManager -> EventListener : 异步/同步发布 AuthenticationSuccessEvent
AuthManager --> Filter : 认证成功 Authentication
Filter -> CtxRepo : saveContext(SecurityContext, req, resp) -> 写入 HttpSession
Filter --> Client : HTTP 200 JSON\n{"user":"admin","session":"xxxx"}

== 场景 B：自定义 Header Token 认证流程 (POST /your-custom-token-login-path) ==
Client -> Chain : POST /your-custom-token-login-path\n(Header: "token: bearer:admin", X-CSRF-TOKEN)
Chain -> Filter : 拦截并提取 Header["token"]
Filter -> Filter : 封装 CustomTokenAuthenticationToken("bearer:admin", null)
Filter -> AuthManager : authenticate(tokenAuth)
AuthManager -> Provider : 路由至 CustomAuthenticationProvider
Provider -> Provider : 解析 Token 提取用户名并赋予权限列表
Provider --> AuthManager : 返回已认证 CustomTokenAuthenticationToken
AuthManager -> EventListener : 发布 AuthenticationSuccessEvent
AuthManager --> Filter : 认证成功
Filter -> CtxRepo : saveContext(SecurityContext, req, resp) -> 写入 HttpSession
Filter --> Client : HTTP 200 JSON\n{"user":"admin","session":"xxxx"}

== 场景 C：认证失败处理 (如密码错误) ==
Client -> Chain : POST /your-custom-login-path\n(JSON: {"username":"admin","password":"wrong"})
Chain -> Filter : 拦截并提交认证
Filter -> AuthManager : authenticate(...)
AuthManager -> Provider : 校验密码
Provider -> Encoder : matches(...)
Encoder --> Provider : 匹配失败
Provider --> AuthManager : 抛出 BadCredentialsException
AuthManager -> EventListener : 发布 AbstractAuthenticationFailureEvent
AuthManager --> Filter : 抛出 AuthenticationException
Filter --> Client : HTTP 401 JSON\n{"msg":"Bad credentials"}

@enduml
